1473	/// a measurement run.
1474	///
1475	/// - `CLOCK_MONOTONIC` freezes while the system is suspended;
1476	///   `CLOCK_BOOTTIME` keeps counting — the divergence of the two
1477	///   elapsed times is the time spent suspended.
1478	/// - Uses std `Instant` (`CLOCK_MONOTONIC`), not `minstant`: we
1479	///   think the TSC keeps counting across s2idle suspend, which is
